# The downloaded datasets, ~23 GB, at the repository root only. Anchored with a
# leading slash on purpose: an unanchored `data/` also matches
# `src/reverberate/data/`, which holds the checked-in material coefficient
# tables, and silently kept them out of the repository until CI caught it.
/data/
.venv/
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.venv-setup.py
.venv-setup.log
.coverage
htmlcov/

# PFFDTD's voxeliser spills one HDF5 per voxel into a *relative* mmap_dat/ and
# memory-maps adj_check.dat beside it. The child is given its own staging
# directory now (see reverberate.wave.voxelise), but anything run by hand from
# the repository root still lands here, and 26 642 of them once reached a
# commit.
mmap_dat/
adj_check.dat
